# Evidence Directory

This directory contains evidence for reproducibility:

## spark_plans/
Spark execution plans (explain formatted) for each pipeline step:
- parse_blocks_plan.txt
- process_prices_plan.txt
- blockchain_features_plan.txt
- advanced_blockchain_features_plan.txt
- price_features_plan.txt
- join_features_plan.txt

## spark_ui_screenshots/
Screenshots from Spark UI (port 4040) showing:
- DAG visualizations
- Stage details
- Storage information
- Executors
- SQL queries

Take screenshots during execution and save here.
